    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Caroline",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)16",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Oh, you've been foraging! Thank you!#$b#I'll make a spicy cocktail sauce with this. That'll put some hair on Pierre's chest.$h",
      "translation": "Jé, to je ze sběru v přírodě! Děkuju!#$b#Udělám z toho pikantní koktejlovou omáčku. Po ní Pierrovi zaručeně narostou chlupy na hrudi.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "39ec152245c89fe241a42807ce6a96c913e8b23beea9f6be6a4afff63ee450bc",
      "translationSHA256": "72ccc28b5164ca0307384f0671ae45e3b3d60f5811c9f19e99026d1a162c54ba",
