    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Caroline",
      "key": "GreenRain_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ah, the special rain is back! This year, I'm going to make the most of it!#$e#This calls for a cup of green tea!$h",
      "translation": "Jé, zvláštní déšť je zpátky! Letos ho využiju naplno!#$e#To si žádá šálek zeleného čaje!$h",
